.\" $NetBSD$
.\"
.Dd June 8, 2026
.Dt CELLADM 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm celladm
.Nd validate and manage declarative cell configuration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm validate
.Nm
.Cm generate
.Nm
.Cm bootstrap
.Nm
.Cm rootfs
.Ar name
.Cm prepare | verify | repair
.Nm
.Cm list
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility manages declarative cell configuration under
.Pa /etc/cells
and runtime layout under
.Pa /var/cells .
It validates
.Pa /etc/cells/cells.d/*.cell
files, generates per-cell
.Xr rc.d 8
scripts in
.Pa /etc/rc.d ,
and prepares readonly-root and overlay runtime state used by
.Xr cellctl 8
and
.Xr secmodel_cell 9 .
.Pp
The commands are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm validate
Parse and validate all
.Pa .cell
files.
Unknown keys and invalid values are rejected.
.It Cm generate
Validate all cell definitions and generate
.Pa /etc/rc.d/cell_<name>
services.
Stale generated services for removed cells are deleted.
.It Cm bootstrap
Ensure base directory layout, ensure
.Nm secmodel_cell
availability, download release sets
.Pq Pa base.tar.xz , Pa etc.tar.xz , optionally Pa xbase.tar.xz
into
.Pa /var/cells/releases/<release>/<arch> ,
extract them into
.Pa /var/cells/base/<release>-<arch> ,
and apply writable-link base shaping.
Release and architecture are taken from
.Pa /etc/cells/defaults.conf
.Pq Va release , Va machine_arch
or auto-detected via
.Xr uname 1 .
The mirror is configured by
.Va netbsd_mirror
or environment
.Va NETBSD_MIRROR ;
default is
.Dq Li https://cdn.netbsd.org/pub/NetBSD/NetBSD-${release}/${machine_arch}/binary/sets .
.It Cm rootfs Ar name Cm prepare | verify | repair
Manage per-cell rootfs overlay layout under
.Pa /var/cells/cells/<name> .
.It Cm list
Show compact desired/runtime status for configured cells.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/cells/cells/<name>/overlay -compact
.It Pa /etc/cells/defaults.conf
Global defaults.
.It Pa /etc/cells/cells.d/*.cell
Per-cell desired state.
.It Pa /etc/cells/hooks/<name>/
Optional lifecycle hooks.
.It Pa /etc/rc.d/cell_<name>
Generated per-cell services.
.It Pa /var/cells/
Runtime base/releases/cell state.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cellctl 8 ,
.Xr rc 8 ,
.Xr rc.conf 5 ,
.Xr service 8 ,
.Xr secmodel_cell 9
